# Gathering Place after the turn it entered. On turn 3 Bot1 controls only a Temple Garden (Forest and Plains types but not
# basic, CR 205.4a) and Bot2 controls an Island (not Bot1's): {G} is refused (the refusal) while {C} is still offered. On
# turn 5 a basic Forest of Bot1's turns the ability back on (the positive control: the same action, the same land).

[Bot1 Deck]
Gathering Place
Temple Garden
Forest
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Gathering Place.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Temple Garden.Play
! Bot1.Battlefield.Gathering Place.Activate(Ability: or; Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Gathering Place.Activate(Ability: {C})
? Bot1.Mana = {C}
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Gathering Place.Activate(Ability: or; Color: Green)

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana = {G}
